src/OpenPortal.Web/wwwroot/assets/
src/OpenPortal.Web/wwwroot/index.html
**/App_Data/
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/TestResults/
.git/
.github/
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.env
.env.*
**/secrets.json
**/appsettings.*.Local.json
